                <pb facs="0617" n="515" xml:id="pg515"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 15984/15.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador O’Brien to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-12-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>My telegram of 17th. Officer Doyle to-day sailed on the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >China</hi> en route Honolulu with Abe.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">O’Brien.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
